# Move a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim to another person on the sheet (by default a steward only; the sheet's permission matrix decides). It keeps its number and date and loses any figure a statement bound it to. A refused move (a role the permission matrix does not allow, a SETTLED or VOID claim, a correction, an unknown or retired person, a claim dated in a closed period) writes nothing, not even an audit line.
